Unicode data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* pkg/data/special-forms.tsv (the table of special letters: a letter, its
  shape, what it writes, the letters it writes, the number it stands for)
  is made by the program in pkg/data/gen from the Unicode Character
  Database 15.0.0 (UnicodeData.txt and Blocks.txt: the letters, their
  decompositions, numeric values and blocks). The Korean names of the
  shapes and contents in it are our own (CC0).
* pkg/data/special-groups.tsv (the table of the default kinds of signs: a
  letter, its kind, what it is inside that kind) is made by the same
  program from the same files: the kinds are read from the blocks and the
  general categories, and the directions of the arrows from the official
  names of the letters. The Korean names of the kinds are our own (CC0).
    License:     Unicode License v3
    Copyright:   Copyright (c) 1991-2022 Unicode, Inc.
    URL:         https://www.unicode.org/license.txt
    Source:      https://www.unicode.org/Public/15.0.0/ucd/
  The data files themselves are not kept in this repository.

